16:07.555 --> 16:15.158
[SPEAKER_02]: incorrectly and either pulled it out and there was nothing attached to it or they physically could not release the handle from their harness

16:15.638 --> 16:22.982
[SPEAKER_02]: and and one of the things that he mentioned i believe in that video or it might have been in a podcast that he did but where he he mentioned this

16:23.002 --> 16:35.073
[SPEAKER_02]: because i i told him my theory on that And he agreed with me from what he had seen just from people's deployments in most cases. And that's the

16:35.113 --> 16:46.423
